{"seq":2,"slug":"system-of-systems","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 体系工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/complex-systems/system-of-systems","wordCount":1806,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-系统工程-体系工程\">研究生 系统工程 — 体系工程</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>体系（System of Systems, SoS）由多个独立运作的组成系统通过协作实现任何单一系统无法达成的能力。互联网、综合防空系统、智慧城市和联合作战体系都是典型的体系。与传统系统不同，体系中的组成系统具有运行独立性（自身有独立使命）和管理独立性（各自有独立的管理权），这使得体系工程面临传统系统工程未曾遇到的治理和演化挑战。</p>\n<p>Mark Maier 提出的体系五大特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>运行独立性（Operational Independence）</strong>：每个组成系统可以独立完成自身使命</li>\n<li><strong>管理独立性（Managerial Independence）</strong>：组成系统有各自的所有者、预算和发展路线</li>\n<li><strong>地理分布（Geographic Distribution）</strong>：组成系统通常分布在不同地理位置</li>\n<li><strong>涌现行为（Emergent Behavior）</strong>：体系层面的能力来自组成系统的协作，不可归因于任何单一系统</li>\n<li><strong>演化发展（Evolutionary Development）</strong>：体系不是一次性设计建成的，而是随时间持续演化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>体系的分类（Dahmann &amp; Baldwin）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>管理方式</th>\n<th>目标设定</th>\n<th>典型案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>导向型（Directed）</td>\n<td>统一指挥</td>\n<td>自顶向下</td>\n<td>军事 C4ISR 系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认可型（Acknowledged）</td>\n<td>有总体架构师</td>\n<td>协商一致</td>\n<td>国家航空管制系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协作型（Collaborative）</td>\n<td>自愿参与</td>\n<td>共识驱动</td>\n<td>开源软件生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟型（Virtual）</td>\n<td>无中央管理</td>\n<td>各自为政</td>\n<td>互联网</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"体系架构方法\">体系架构方法</h3><p>体系架构不同于传统系统架构——你不能&quot;设计&quot;一个你不完全控制的系统的架构，只能&quot;影响&quot;它。</p>\n<p><strong>DoDAF SV-1 视图</strong>是描述体系接口关系的标准工具。在体系层面，关注的不是组件内部结构，而是组成系统之间的能力接口和信息交换。</p>\n<p>体系架构的核心决策是<strong>互操作性层级</strong>的选取。LISI（Levels of Information Systems Interoperability）模型定义了 5 个互操作性级别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>数据交换方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>Isolated</td>\n<td>人工转录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Connected</td>\n<td>电子邮件、文件传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Functional</td>\n<td>共享数据格式、消息传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Domain</td>\n<td>共享数据模型和业务规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Enterprise</td>\n<td>语义互操作、自动协商</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每提升一级互操作性，技术复杂度和治理难度都显著增加。体系架构师需要为每对组成系统选择最小充分的互操作性级别。</p>\n<h3 id=\"能力工程\">能力工程</h3><p>体系的价值体现在能力（Capability）——多个系统协作完成特定使命的能力。能力工程方法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>能力需求分析</strong>：识别体系需要提供但任何单一系统无法独立提供的能力</li>\n<li><strong>能力分解</strong>：将体系能力分解为组成系统需要贡献的子能力</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Capability</mtext><mtext>SoS</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>⨁</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>Contribution</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>Synergy</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Capability}_{\\text{SoS}} = \\bigoplus_{i=1}^{n} \\text{Contribution}_i + \\text{Synergy}(\\{S_i\\})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Capability</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SoS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⨁</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Contribution</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Synergy</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⨁</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bigoplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⨁</span></span></span></span></span> 表示组合算子（不是简单求和），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Synergy</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Synergy}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Synergy</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是协作涌现的增量。</p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><strong>能力差距分析</strong>：比较现有组成系统的能力与体系需求之间的差距</li>\n<li><strong>演化路线图</strong>：规划分阶段地缩小能力差距——考虑到管理独立性，路线图更多是建议而非指令</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"体系涌现性分析\">体系涌现性分析</h3><p>涌现行为是体系的核心特征也是核心风险。涌现可以是期望的（联合防空能力）也可能是非期望的（级联故障）。</p>\n<p><strong>网络分析</strong>提供了理解体系涌现行为的工具。将体系建模为图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = (V, E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中顶点为组成系统，边为交互关系。关键的网络度量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>度中心性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>deg</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_D(v) = \\frac{\\text{deg}(v)}{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4133em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deg</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，识别连接最多的关键系统</li>\n<li><strong>介数中心性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_B(v) = \\sum_{s \\neq v \\neq t} \\frac{\\sigma_{st}(v)}{\\sigma_{st}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4551em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mord vbox mtight\"><span class=\"thinbox mtight\"><span class=\"rlap mtight\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak mtight\"></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mord vbox mtight\"><span class=\"thinbox mtight\"><span class=\"rlap mtight\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak mtight\"></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，识别信息流的瓶颈系统</li>\n<li><strong>聚类系数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_C(v) = \\frac{2|\\{e_{jk}\\}|}{k_v(k_v-1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5581em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0381em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5131em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2∣</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，衡量局部子群的紧密程度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>级联故障建模：当节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 失效时，其负载重新分配给邻居。如果邻居的新负载超过其容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_j = (1+\\alpha) \\cdot L_j^0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2089em;vertical-align:-0.3948em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为容量裕度），则该邻居也失效。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 低于某个临界值时，单一节点故障可能引发全局级联。</p>\n<h3 id=\"体系治理\">体系治理</h3><p>由于管理独立性，体系无法像传统系统那样通过层级命令进行管理。治理机制包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>标准与协议</strong>：通过统一的接口标准和数据格式降低协作摩擦</li>\n<li><strong>激励机制</strong>：设计使组成系统自愿参与协作的激励结构</li>\n<li><strong>演化合同</strong>：允许组成系统按自己的节奏升级，同时保证向后兼容性</li>\n<li><strong>测试与认证</strong>：定期的互操作性测试确保体系能力不退化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>形式化地，体系治理可以用机制设计（Mechanism Design）理论建模——设计一个博弈规则使得各组成系统在追求自身利益的同时实现体系层面的目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>选择一个你熟悉的体系（如城市交通体系或医疗急救体系），识别其组成系统，分类为 Maier 的哪种类型，并分析它展现的涌现行为（期望的和非期望的）</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为一个&quot;智慧港口&quot;体系设计互操作性矩阵：组成系统包括船舶管理系统、港口调度系统、海关系统、物流跟踪系统和气象服务系统。为每对系统确定合适的 LISI 互操作性级别并论证选择理由</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>构建一个包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点的体系网络模型，计算每个节点的度中心性和介数中心性。模拟去除介数中心性最高的节点后，体系的连通性如何变化？这对体系鲁棒性设计有什么启示？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论互联网作为虚拟型体系的演化历史：从 ARPANET 到今天的全球互联网，哪些治理机制（如 IETF RFC 过程、BGP 协议）使得没有中央管理者的条件下仍能维持全局协作？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Mark Maier 的原始论文&quot;Architecting Principles for Systems-of-Systems&quot;（1998）奠定了体系工程的理论框架</li>\n<li>Jamshidi 编辑的《Systems of Systems Engineering: Principles and Applications》是该领域最全面的参考书</li>\n<li>INCOSE Systems Engineering Handbook 中关于 SoS 的章节整合了最新的实践指南</li>\n<li>DoD 的《Systems Engineering Guide for Systems of Systems》提供了军事领域的方法论和案例</li>\n<li>对于涌现性的理论分析，可以参考 Holland 的《Emergence: From Chaos to Order》</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>体系工程面对的核心挑战是在组成系统运行独立和管理独立的约束下，实现体系层面的涌现能力。互操作性层级选择、能力工程和治理机制设计是体系工程师的三大核心技能。网络分析和级联故障建模帮助理解和管理体系的涌现风险。体系不是&quot;更大的系统&quot;——它需要从控制思维转向影响思维、从设计思维转向演化思维。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 系统工程 — 体系工程","id":"研究生-系统工程-体系工程"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"体系架构方法","id":"体系架构方法"},{"level":3,"text":"能力工程","id":"能力工程"},{"level":3,"text":"体系涌现性分析","id":"体系涌现性分析"},{"level":3,"text":"体系治理","id":"体系治理"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 系统工程 — 信息物理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/complex-systems/cyber-physical-systems"},"next":{"title":"研究生 系统工程 — 韧性工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/complex-systems/resilience-engineering"}}